  "content": "\n\nHello World\n你好世界\n<a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/bisect\"><img width=100% src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702795/bisect.png\"></a>\n<img width=100% src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ObscuriaLithium/obscurialithium.github.io/refs/heads/main/assets/images/obscure-tooltips-logo.jpg\">\n\n<center>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"NeoForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Neo Forge-5c2148?style=for-the-badge\"></a> \n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=&labelColor=231C25&color=5c2a21\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/obscure-tooltips-media-kit-VPpfjxP\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Media Kit\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Get%20Media%20Kit-5c4521?style=for-the-badge&logo=imgur&labelColor=251C20&logoColor=white\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n### <center>Obscure Tooltips 是一款完全基于客户端的视觉增强模组，它将普通的物品提示框转化为富有表现力的动态展示。通过引入流畅的动画、动态粒子效果以及根据物品稀有度和上下文自适应的装饰性边框，为你的背包增添了沉浸式的视觉特效。</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769699368/header/features.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769703577/obscure-tooltips-showcase-1.gif\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>动画工具提示</h1>\n            <p>流畅的动画、发光边框与细腻的粒子效果让每一个提示框都栩栩如生。样式支持丰富的视觉修饰——从动态纹饰到多层特效——让每一件物品都显得独特而富有表现力。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>集成模型</h1>\n            <p>在提示框内直接查看任何盔甲、工具或武器的完整 3D 模型。无需装备或打开额外菜单即可即时预览装备。</p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769703746/obscure-tooltips-showcase-2.jpg\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769703975/obscure-tooltips-showcase-3.gif\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>平滑滚动</h1>\n            <p>当提示框内容超出屏幕高度时，自动平滑滚动将激活，在保持文本清晰可读的同时避免界面杂乱。让你能够自然流畅地阅读长描述，无需调整用户界面尺寸。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>智能换行</h1>\n            <p>智能换行功能保持宽提示框的整洁、易读与完美排版。长名称、背景故事与属性数值将保持对齐，绝不会溢出布局范围。</p>\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769703747/obscure-tooltips-showcase-4.jpg\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"60%\">\n            <img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4yIqabL.gif\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"40%\">\n            <h1>无与伦比的自定义</h1>\n            <p>Obscure Tooltips 是首款引入全动态、视觉丰富提示框的模组。尽管此后出现了类似作品，但其模块化、数据驱动的设计仍提供了一种独一无二的灵活方式，让你可以 <a href=\"https://obscurialithium.github.io/obscure-tooltips/#tooltip-styles\">构建</a> 和 <a href=\"https://obscurialithium.github.io/obscure-tooltips/#style-merging-fallback\">合并样式</a>， <a href=\"https://obscurialithium.github.io/obscure-tooltips/#tooltip-filters\">创建条件</a>，以及 <a href=\"https://obscurialithium.github.io/obscure-tooltips/#core-concept\">自定义每个元素</a>，以完美契合你的设计构想。</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2zmjwZJ.png\"></center>\n\n<br>\n\n## 游戏内配置\n在 Minecraft 1.20.1 中，搭配 [Forge Config Screens](https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-screens) 或 [Configured](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured) 模组即可启用游戏内配置菜单。若未安装这些模组，所有设置仍可通过配置文件进行调整（<i>config/obscuria/obscure_tooltips-client.toml</i>）。自 Minecraft 1.21.1 起，游戏内配置菜单已开箱即用，无需任何额外依赖。\n\n<br>\n\n<center><img width=80% src=https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769699408/header/more-from-obscuria.png></center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aquamirae\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/aquamirae.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/obscure-tooltips\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/obscure-tooltips.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/pillager-caravans\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/pillager-caravans.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ars-elixirum\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/ars-elixirum.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/accents\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/quXJZzx.png\" width=\"45%\" /></a> \n  <img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/blank.png\" width=\"45%\" />\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Obscuria\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/patreon.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\"><img style=\"display: inline;\" src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702990/discord.png\" width=\"90%\" /></a>\n</center>",
